        {"source": "spec", "quote": "three independent CS Output pins on GPIO4/GPIO6/GPIO7"}
      ],
      "impact": "Firmware that toggles GPIO4/GPIO6/GPIO7 would select the wrong thermocouple channels: GPIO4 would assert CS1 (U3), GPIO6 would assert CS2 (U4), and GPIO7 would select nothing. U2/CS0 would never be selected, and the third zone would have no chip select.",
